│ @ latest.log    ╭──────────────────────── Update Borg ─────────────────────────╮                 │
│ · README.md     │                                                              │                 │
│ ? socket        │  Borg 0.11.0 is out, and this computer runs 0.10.0. Install  │                 │
│ · 日本語メモ.txt│  it now?                                                     │                 │
│                 │                                                              │                 │
│                 │   /usr/local/bin/borg update                                 │                 │
│                 │                                                              │                 │
│                 │  The command runs in Borg's shell. Open sessions move to     │                 │
│                 │  the new version once they are idle, and they keep their     │                 │
│                 │  shells.                                                     │                 │
│                 │                                                              │                 │
│                 │  S skips this version until a newer one is out. N turns the  │                 │
│                 │  daily check off, and update-check = true in the config      │                 │
│                 │  turns it back on. After Esc, Borg asks again a day later.   │                 │
│                 ╰── Enter Update · S Skip version · N Never ask · Esc Later ───╯                 │
│                                                ││                                                │
